flowchart TD
  A[Form overview] --> B{Need a similar form?}
  B -->|No| Z[Stay on overview / other actions]
  B -->|Yes| C{Copy draft or live?}

  C -->|Draft| D[Open Make a copy — source draft]
  C -->|Live| E[Open Make a copy — source live]

  D --> F[Name new form + review checks]
  E --> F

  F -->|Cancel| A
  F -->|Make a copy| G[Clone pages, questions, details as new draft]

  G --> H[Land on new form overview]
  H --> I[Success: copied as draft]
  I --> J[Edit draft / check org support privacy]
  J --> K[Journey complete]

  classDef decision fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#b36b00
  classDef system fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#1a5fb4
  classDef success fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#1e7e34

  class B,C decision
  class G system
  class I,K success
